OL,3,GNEWSAWales falls further behind rest of
OL,4,AUK in international school tests
OL,5,
OL,6,FWales' performance in international
OL,7,Ftests for 15-year-olds has fallen
OL,8,Ffurther behind other UK nations.
OL,10,FThe biggest drop was in maths scores
OL,11,Fwith reading results also lower, while
OL,12,Faverage science scores in the
OL,13,Fthree-yearly Pisa (Programme for
OL,14,FInternational Student Assessment) study
OL,15,Fwere slightly up.
OL,17,FThe tests were taken by a sample of
OL,18,Fteenagers in 91 countries and economies
OL,19,Fin 2025, and are seen as an important
OL,20,Fyardstick of how education systems are
OL,21,Fperforming.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
